 Slater donated his $250,000 salary to two of Phoenix\\u0026#39;s favorite charities.\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"machineTranslatedText\":{\"language\":{\"id\":\"en-US\"},\"value\":{\"plaidHtml\":\"\\u003ca class=\\\"ipc-md-link ipc-md-link--entity\\\" href=\\\"/name/nm0000225/?ref_=dyk_trv\\\"\\u003eChristian Slater\\u003c/a\\u003e was given the role of Daniel Malloy upon the death of \\u003ca class=\\\"ipc-md-link ipc-md-link--entity\\\" href=\\\"/name/nm0000203/?ref_=dyk_trv\\\"\\u003eRiver Phoenix\\u003c/a\\u003e, the original choice for the role. Slater donated his $250,000 salary to two of Phoenix\\u0026#39;s favorite charities.\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"isMachineTranslation\":false,\"__typename\":\"MachineTranslatedMarkdown\"},\"trademark\":null,\"machineTranslatedTrademark\":null,\"relatedNames\":null,\"__typename\":\"TitleTrivia\"},\"__typename\":\"TriviaEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"TriviaConnection\"},\"goofsTotal\":{\"total\":43,\"__typename\":\"GoofConnection\"},\"goofs\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"text\":{\"plaidHtml\":\"(at around 1h 16 mins) In the Theatre des Vampires, Santiago unties the string on the woman\\u0026#39;s shirt but just seconds before this it is seen already untied and she moves it to cover herself.\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"machineTranslatedText\":{\"language\":{\"id\":\"en-US\"},\"value\":{\"plaidHtml\":\"(at around 1h 16 mins) In the Theatre des Vampires, Santiago unties the string on the woman\\u0026#39;s shirt but just seconds before this it is seen already untied and she moves it to cover herself.\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"isMachineTranslation\":false,\"__typename\":\"MachineTranslatedMarkdown\"},\"__typename\":\"Goof\"},\"__typename\":\"GoofEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"GoofConnection\"},\"quotesTotal\":{\"total\":100,\"__typename\":\"TitleQuoteConnection\"},\"quotes\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"displayableArticle\":{\"body\":{\"plaidHtml\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca class=\\\"ipc-md-link ipc-md-link--entity\\\" href=\\\"/name/nm0000129/?ref_=tt_dyk_qu\\\"\\u003eLestat\\u003c/a\\u003e: Don\\u0026#39;t be afraid. I\\u0026#39;m going to give you the choice I never had.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"__typename\":\"DisplayableArticle\"},\"machineTranslatedDisplayableArticle\":{\"body\":{\"language\":{\"id\":\"en-US\"},\"value\":{\"plaidHtml\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca class=\\\"ipc-md-link ipc-md-link--entity\\\" href=\\\"/name/nm0000129/?ref_=tt_dyk_qu\\\"\\u003eLestat\\u003c/a\\u003e: Don\\u0026#39;t be afraid. I\\u0026#39;m going to give you the choice I never had.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"isMachineTranslation\":false,\"__typename\":\"MachineTranslatedMarkdown\"},\"__typename\":\"MachineTranslatedDisplayableArticle\"},\"__typename\":\"TitleQuote\"},\"__typename\":\"TitleQuoteEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"TitleQuoteConnection\"},\"crazyCredits\":{\"edges\":[],\"__typename\":\"CrazyCreditConnection\"},\"alternateVersions\":{\"total\":1,\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"text\":{\"plaidHtml\":\"Reportedly, in original screenings of the film there was extra footage in the scene where Louis finds the burnt bodies of Madeleine and Claudia. In this version, after the bodies crumple to ashes, Louis takes Madeleine\\u0026#39;s locket that has the picture of the little girl who resembles Claudia.\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"machineTranslatedDisplayableArticle\":{\"body\":{\"language\":{\"id\":\"en-US\"},\"value\":{\"plaidHtml\":\"Reportedly, in original screenings of the film there was extra footage in the scene where Louis finds the burnt bodies of Madeleine and Claudia. In this version, after the bodies crumple to ashes, Louis takes Madeleine\\u0026#39;s locket that has the picture of the little girl who resembles Claudia.\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"isMachineTranslation\":false,\"__typename\":\"MachineTranslatedMarkdown\"},\"__typename\":\"MachineTranslatedDisplayableArticle\"},\"__typename\":\"AlternateVersion\"},\"__typename\":\"AlternateVersionEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"AlternateVersionConnection\"},\"connections\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"associatedTitle\":{\"id\":\"tt0898925\",\"releaseYear\":{\"year\":2007,\"__typename\":\"YearRange\"},\"titleText\":{\"text\":\"Island of the Living Dead\",\"__typename\":\"TitleText\"},\"originalTitleText\":{\"text\":\"L'isola dei morti viventi\",\"__typename\":\"TitleText\"},\"series\":null,\"__typename\":\"Title\"},\"category\":{\"text\":\"Edited into\",\"__typename\":\"TitleConnectionCategory\"},\"__typename\":\"TitleConnection\"},\"__typename\":\"TitleConnectionEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"TitleConnectionConnection\"},\"soundtrack\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"text\":\"Terpsichore and Harp Concerto in B Flat\",\"comments\":[{\"plaidHtml\":\"Written by \\u003ca class=\\\"ipc-md-link ipc-md-link--entity\\\" href=\\\"/name/nm0005594/?ref_=dyk_snd\\\"\\u003eGeorge Frideric Handel\\u003c/a\\u003e (as George Frederick Handel)\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},{\"plaidHtml\":\"Adapted by \\u003ca class=\\\"ipc-md-link ipc-md-link--entity\\\" href=\\\"/name/nm0006070/?ref_=dyk_snd\\\"\\u003eGeorge Fenton\\u003c/a\\u003e\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},{\"plaidHtml\":\"Performed by \\u003ca class=\\\"ipc-md-link ipc-md-link--entity\\\" href=\\\"/name/nm2790493/?ref_=dyk_snd\\\"\\u003eThe King\\u0026#39;s Consort\\u003c/a\\u003e\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"}],\"__typename\":\"Track\"},\"__typename\":\"SoundtrackEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"SoundtrackConnection\"},\"faqs\":{\"total\":22,\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"id\":\"fq0015578\",\"question\":{\"plainText\":\"Is \\\"Interview with the Vampire\\\" based on a book?\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"machineTranslatedQuestion\":{\"language\":{\"id\":\"en\"},\"value\":{\"plainText\":\"Is \\\"Interview with the Vampire\\\" based on a book?\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"isMachineTranslation\":false,\"__typename\":\"MachineTranslatedMarkdown\"},\"__typename\":\"Faq\"},\"__type