ere watered down. While the relentlessly dark tone and complex character dynamics captivated most viewers, engagement proved divisive, with some feeling emotionally disconnected despite the film&#39;s technical brilliance.\"}}},\"themes\":[{\"themeId\":\"adaptation-of-source-material\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Adaptation of source material\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"complex-characters\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Complex characters\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"dark-tone\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Dark tone\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"directorial-vision\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Directorial vision\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"engagement-level\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Engagement level\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"gothic-elements\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Gothic elements\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"iconic-performance\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Iconic performance\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"individual-performances\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Individual performances\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"moody-atmosphere\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Moody atmosphere\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"},{\"themeId\":\"production-design\",\"label\":{\"value\":\"Production design\"},\"sentiment\":\"POSITIVE\"}]}}},\"extensions\":{\"disclaimer\":\"Public, commercial, and/or non-private use of the IMDb data provided by this API is not allowed. For limited non-commercial use of IMDb data and the associated requirements see https://help.imdb.com/article/imdb/general-information/can-i-use-imdb-data-in-my-software/G5JTRESSHJBBHTGX#\",\"experimentalFields\":{\"janet\":[]},\"entitlements\":{\"fields\":{\"Title.reviewSummary\":\"GRANT\"},\"inUse\":true}}}\n"},"redirectURL":"","headersSize":-1,"bodySize":-1,"_transferSize":1190,"_error":null,"_fetchedViaServiceWorker":false},"serverIPAddress":"18.239.255.100","startedDateTime":"2026-10-31T10:47:07.781Z","time":699.7790000023087,"